              <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-1">Our recurring weekend action sports clinic. Focused on fundamental skateboarding and progressive ramp skills for all levels.</p>
              <button onclick="window.open('https://wa.me/916304895686?text=Hi%2C%20I%20want%20to%20inquire%20about%20the%20Sunday%20Skateboarding%20Workshop%20event.', '_blank')" class="w-full py-4 bg-charcoal text-white font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs hover:bg-gray-800 transition-colors">
