          <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display font-bold mt-2 mb-6">Safety & Protection</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg mb-12 leading-relaxed">We strictly enforce a mandatory 4-point CE/EN certified protection policy. All skaters must use non-marking PU wheels (82A-86A) to protect court surfaces.</p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
            <div class="p-6 bg-white border border-border-gray"><div class="text-4xl mb-4">⛑️</div><h4 class="font-display font-bold">Helmet</h4></div>
